# agents/ tracks:
#   - LICENSE, CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, system-packages.txt (proprietary, authored)
#   - .gitmodules + each cloned third-party skill as a git submodule
#   - any fsh-*/ skill dirs we author
# and ignores per-runtime junk + any video/audio/model files that might
# leak in during agent operation.

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Python build noise (if a submodule pip-installs into here for some reason)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Defense-in-depth: deny heavy binary formats anywhere under agents/
# (submodules' contents are gitignored by submodule semantics, but if
#  a heavy file ever ends up in our tracked tree, this catches it)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.m4v
*.flv
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.ggml
*.onnx
*.ckpt
*.h5
